        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 10. Premium pay provisions do not apply to part time employees except that double time shall be paid for hours worked on holidays (see Article VIII, Section 2) and triple time shall be paid for hours worked on Sunday (in accordance with Article III, Section 3).",
